:: Fishing start
<<fishing_init>> /*bootup fishing*/

you grab your <<if $line_strength gte 0>> bad quality <<elseif $line_strength gte 50>> decent quality 
<<else>> masterwork quality <</if>>fishingrod and look in your baitbox<<if $fish_bait gt 0>> counting 
<<print $fish_bait>> pieces of bait.<<else>> it seems to be empty.<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link[[start fishing|fishing system]]>><</link>>



::fishing system
<<fishing_display>>
<<set $fish_position to { x: random(0, 10), y: random(0, 4) }>>

<<if $line_strength gte 0>>
	<<link[[reel|fishing system]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<<link[[rest|fishing system]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
	<<link[[exhaust|fishing system]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link[[stop fishing|fishing system]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
